{
  "slug": "md-linker",
  "name": "Md Linker",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Markdown link graph and staleness detection for Claude Code. Automatically tracks cross-references between markdown documents and detects when linked content becomes stale.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 commands** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Commands** (5): `graph` (Generate a dependency graph of all markdown links, rendered as PNG (or .dot if graphviz not installed)), `init` (Scan all .md files and build the link graph (.md-linker/graph.json)), `rebuild` (Rebuild the link graph from scratch (clears snapshots/diffs)), `resolve` (Remove all stale-refs frontmatter annotations from all files), `status` (Show all stale documents with their summaries)\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install md-linker@claude-community` from `Dev-Jahn/md-linker`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 3,
    "command": 5
  },
